  "description": "Peak is a single tepee tower with a beam on each side. A curved climbing ladder with holds takes children up to the deck and a purple double slide brings them down. One beam carries a nest swing, and the other carries a row of hanging stepping pods to balance across. That gives one structure climbing, sliding, swinging and balancing, which helps a society with room for only one main piece. Peak is listed for 25 to 30 children. It needs a product area of 25'6\" x 24'1\" and a safe play area of 31'6\" x 30'1\". Skills on its list are problem solving, creative thinking, focus and self control. Peak is finished in mixed colours, and its pipes, moulded parts, laminates and play rope have a 3-year warranty. Call +91 902 830 2266 for a layout.",
